sequenceDiagram
    participant GOV as CMP-011 Governance
    participant EVAL as CMP-008 Evaluation
    participant RUN as CMP-010 Benchmark Runner
    participant TGT as Target Inference Endpoint
    participant OBS as CMP-009 Observation
    participant ORCH as CMP-003 Orchestration

    GOV->>EVAL: Approved WP profile + INF profile + policy digest
    EVAL->>RUN: DATA-127 scenario, quality dataset, cache state
    RUN->>TGT: Baseline requests (speculation disabled)
    TGT-->>RUN: TTFT, ITL, E2E, tokens, memory, outcomes
    RUN->>TGT: Candidate requests with declared speculative method
    TGT-->>RUN: Metrics + acceptance + verification evidence
    RUN->>OBS: DATA-128 observations (no raw payload)
    OBS->>EVAL: Normalized baseline/candidate evidence
    EVAL->>EVAL: Quality parity + lossless claim + acceptance + latency + memory gates
    alt Any gate fails
        EVAL-->>GOV: Disable recommendation for profile
    else All gates pass
        EVAL-->>GOV: DATA-130 advisory recommendation
    end
    GOV-->>ORCH: No automatic DATA-106 change
